            "type": "game",
            "name": "Captain Lycop : Invasion of the Heters",
            "steam_appid": 525070,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<strong>Mankind has received a transmission from space. An alien ship is coming. A hardened officer has been choosen to assess the danger.<br><br>Dive into the heart of <i>Captain Lycop: Invasion of the Heters</i>, a space shooter mixing adventure, action and management. Face off against pen-pushing insects, merciless enemies and epic bosses. Your only hope is to banish all cowardice and follow a virtuous path.</strong><br><br><i>Captain Lycop: Invasion of the Heters</i> gives players a space shooter with complete freedom of movement.<br><br>Shoot your way through several zones and a complex story.<br><br>Scavenge ennemy ships to equip modules on your own. Your ship holds up to seven modules pointed in any direction, allowing you to choose your play style.<br><br>With a wide tech tree, replay the adventure with varying strategies choosing among 31 different technologies.<br><br>Discover an alien universe with its own rules, mixing friendly yet annoying pacifists, administrators with little regard for your future and conquerors with no morals.<br><br>The outcome of the adventure will depend on your choices.<br><br>But most of all you must overcome! Overcome hoards of enemies, led by bosses as feared as they are fearless! Overcome with no fear!<br><br>Because Captain Lycop is no coward.",
            "about_the_game": "<strong>Mankind has received a transmission from space. An alien ship is coming. A hardened officer has been choosen to assess the danger.<br><br>Dive into the heart of <i>Captain Lycop: Invasion of the Heters</i>, a space shooter mixing adventure, action and management. Face off against pen-pushing insects, merciless enemies and epic bosses. Your only hope is to banish all cowardice and follow a virtuous path.</strong><br><br><i>Captain Lycop: Invasion of the Heters</i> gives players a space shooter with complete freedom of movement.<br><br>Shoot your way through several zones and a complex story.<br><br>Scavenge ennemy ships to equip modules on your own. Your ship holds up to seven modules pointed in any direction, allowing you to choose your play style.<br><br>With a wide tech tree, replay the adventure with varying strategies choosing among 31 different technologies.<br><br>Discover an alien universe with its own rules, mixing friendly yet annoying pacifists, administrators with little regard for your future and conquerors with no morals.<br><br>The outcome of the adventure will depend on your choices.<br><br>But most of all you must overcome! Overcome hoards of enemies, led by bosses as feared as they are fearless! Overcome with no fear!<br><br>Because Captain Lycop is no coward.",
            "short_description": "A space shooter mixing adventure, action and tactics. Face off against pen-pushing insects, merciless enemies and epic bosses. Your only hope is to banish all cowardice and follow a virtuous path.",
